Date: Tue, 6 Oct 2026 01:28:10 +0700
Subject: [PATCH 5/5] fedi/compat-overlay: upstream-churned files re-applied
 (Elk footer, lint/drag fixes, Dockerfile qrtool, locales, sw-locales rename)

---
 Dockerfile                                        | 15 +++++++++++++++
 .../glitch/components/scrollable_list/index.jsx   |  2 +-
 .../local_settings/navigation/item/index.jsx      |  1 +
 .../notifications/components/pill_bar_button.jsx  |  1 +
 .../glitch/features/ui/components/link_footer.tsx |  5 +++++
 .../mastodon/components/scrollable_list/index.jsx |  2 +-
